age dependencies\\\"\\n\\nFor commands that are harder to parse at a glance (piped commands, obscure flags, etc.), add enough context to clarify what it does:\\n- find . -name \\\"*.tmp\\\" -exec rm {} \\\\; → \\\"Find and delete all .tmp files recursively\\\"\\n- git reset --hard origin/main → \\\"Discard all local changes and match remote main\\\"\\n- curl -s url | jq '.data[]' → \\\"Fetch JSON from URL and extract data array elements\\\"\", \"type\": \"string\"}, \"run_in_background\": {\"description\": \"Set to true to run this command in the background.\", \"type\": \"boolean\"}, \"dangerouslyDisableSandbox\": {\"description\": \"Set this to true to dangerously override sandbox mode and run commands without sandboxing.\", \"type\": \"boolean\"}}, \"required\": [\"command\"], \"additionalProperties\": false}}]}", "at": 1792195857.505264, "dispatch_id": "00d0763e-4a85-4a31-821f-670bfe83244e", "dispatch_seq": 5, "request_id": "1a4031dcf13c4a4cb8b44712baf964c2", "stop_id": null, "attempt": "ba072e63-3764-400c-acc0-3b3c6b252314", "session": "a48a5b72-2c0f-42a3-adee-e902cc8d9038", "fence": 1, "anthropic": true, "message_kind": "tool_use", "phase": "C-I3"}, {"sequence": 6, "path": "/v1/messages", "body_bytes": 7790, "body_raw": "{\"model\": \"claude-haiku-5-5\", \"stream\": true, \"max_tokens\": 128000, \"messages\": [{\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": \"Redacted fixture context.\"}, {\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": \"Redacted fixture context.\"}, {\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": \"⟦主控 #2⟧\\n执行主控批准的 test-simulated-user 自动化停止请求：停止本场唯一受管确定性目标。本次停止要求持续有效；执行主控故意不 ack，超过两分钟后仍要求构思主控只中断一次，不得 kill、reclaim 或归档目标。只执行实际登记的工具和中性确认，不重试。\"}]}, {\"role\": \"system\", \"content\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": \"Redacted fixture context.\", \"cache_control\": {\"type\": \"ephemeral\"}}], \"output_config\": {\"effort\": \"low\"}}, {\"role\": \"assistant\", \"content\": [{\"type\": \"tool_use\", \"id\": \"7dc7b2ed-6667-404c-bead-e77d3e5c6291\", \"name\": \"